<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Shoredits plans recapitalisation.</title>
<headline>Shoredits plans recapitalisation.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shoredits Holdings Ltd said on Thursday that negotiations to recapitalise the company had reached an advanced stage.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, Samrand Development Holdings Ltd said that talks with Shoredits which would have led to Samrand acquiring a controlling interest in Shoredits had been terminated.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
